Z||000003||Linx||03-26-2000||12:18 AM||||I found them at Autozone.  I'd purchased manifold gaskets...and it turned out to be a whole kit...<I>all the gaskets</I>.  Even the EGR tube gaskets; both ends.  The kid was made for several pontiac engines, and there were lots of gaskets.  But all the Fiero gaskets were in there.  It was like $22 for all.||||reg||1
